1B6"}, {"file_name": "Debriefing_NBU_Kitchen01.png", "id": "1405679083860780", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391890_1405679087194113_3656226819199594314_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IzkH9QOdQEoQ7kNvwHlneGx&_nc_oc=Adojlj7IvyTW6hUZedrzgA3st9wjMvSABrWcRu1NQwUA-wnK4FNe0ZbHK4CTuMt-2yE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRL7jurZSutO4TMn-nzr2Q-fB8BU2T3kDGKcRVMhSllKg&oe=6B0C6E80"}, {"file_name": "Debriefing_NBU_Garden02 Kopie.png", "id": "1315126803108086", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392010_1315126806441419_2204443393758663212_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p3xbsR01wLUQ7kNvwFE57pX&_nc_oc=Adp8UDFq7S4DGsawn50e6a6XEGE0e5NFU19RENv0mPIjAt5jvD6ATQXtuRXlqL9tsjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTDRCG2Y3ttUCUvZka2sMb9Y5PD0snJVHHoNORLnqzuag&oe=6B0C6D86"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Swiss Safety VR: At home", "keywords": ["Home", "Accidents", "Prevention", "Safety", "Tools"], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in a new dimension of safety in your own house with this advanced, highly immersive VR experience! Encounter various challenging situations and learn about common accident situations from the first person perspective. \n\nWith a realistic, detailed setting, this VR experience lets you experience the downsides of faulty and unsafe behavior up close. Sharpen your skills and recognize the importance of safe behavior at home without risking injury.\n\nOur VR experience not only provides a safe experience, but also an engaging way to raise awareness of hazards in your own house. Embark on your personal safety mission - because safety at home shouldn't be wishful thinking. The revolution in safety-oriented training starts here.", "short_description": "Experience typical accident situations at home. Recognize risks and learn from incorrect actions. The detailed VR environment allows you to experience accident hazards without the risk of injury. The revolution in safety-orientated training starts here."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "9555973314490349", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393909_9555973317823682_8992091524774234384_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1JMmeDWNVjIQ7kNvwHKGoXi&_nc_oc=Adp7F0zWh-UHer0AfRzndRpjErhT9l8EvSzHmZDWX_Oy9A2RezFh3KGSVMvKY1zU22Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQKkQ8YMCafYmWH5wR9Q8qRIk5x7r3wCg_N5BXnfJBCmA&oe=6B0C5BAA"}, {"file_name": "NBUCover - Quadrat.png", "id": "2101800810297381", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828108_2101800816964047_2307820563314405311_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GcjNjJ9IZeEQ7kNvwHAc89e&_nc_oc=AdrrLgcatS-9wEbsTk5em7cjkTVxoQVHUZ6e8D-OsVxs3h4iplRHKJytGq5QKwIodQA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRbwsO5knNufk7fOm0ovFR5bL8vTR8Dh01HTB8KnPCJrw&oe=6B0C6A6C"}, {"file_name": "NBUCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1402262140795424", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822746_1402262144128757_8694036535194985668_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AomD705gWqgQ7kNvwGOLven&_nc_oc=Adqsn1Gxcs2wFzh4sCH0AKWFG7L08P3x9Kt9Due0N8Sff07EHjpWMhjK3afr0uMu0us&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSs0T6xL0p7nPqyAe8btOgkojT27-j13AbFHXCHw9RxKw&oe=6B0C7C30"}, {"file_name": "NBUCover - Querformat 24 bit.png", "id": "1244621193936533", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820141_1244621197269866_7565504577213328925_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlge